data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"Implemented the React greeting-colour interface as specified in DESIGN.md.\\n\\nWhat was done:\\n- Merged the orchestrator's design ref (`refs/campaign/orchestrator`) into the local branch.\\n- Created a Vite + React app in `~/hello-app`.\\n- Installed `@codesweep-ai/ui@^0.3.0` via `npm install`; no optional peer dependencies (`mermaid`, `puppeteer`, `pixelmatch`, `pngjs`) were installed.\\n- Built the UI using `AppShell`, `Header`, `Footer`, `Page`, `Card`, and `Button` from `@codesweep-ai/ui`.\\n- Imported the required design-system styles at the entry point (`src/main.jsx`).\\n- Held the active greeting colour in `useState`, starting from `--color-info`.\\n- Applied greeting colours via CSS custom-property tokens (`--color-info`, `--color-success`, `--color-warning`, `--color-error`), not hard-coded hex values.\\n- Used the `primary` variant for the currently active colour button and `secondary` for the others.\\n- Configured the dev server in `vite.config.js` to bind to `0.0.0.0:5173`.\\n- Wrote `.gitignore` with `node_modules/` and `dist/` before the first commit.\\n- Wrote `README.md` documenting the build and serve commands.\\n\\nVerification:\\n- `npm run build` completed successfully.\\n- `npm run dev` started and bound to `0.0.0.0:5173` (Vite reported `Network: http://10.89.2.201:5173/`).\\n\\nBranch committed to:\\n`cs-sandbox/<DEVELOPER:1>.<GROUP:1>`\\n\\nCommit:\\n`6368d0e Implement React greeting-colour interface per DESIGN.md`\\n\\nCommands documented in README.md:\\n- Build: `npm run build`\\n- Serve: `npm run dev`\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_45","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959174,"id":"chatcmpl-b46a86d178ea4cf99ad6c7a779c8709c","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","u